          "body": "### Docker settings file never loaded\n\n**Medium Severity**\n\n<!-- DESCRIPTION START -->\n`BuildConfiguration` only calls `AddEnvironmentVariables`, so `appsettings.Docker.json` is never read even though it is copied into the image and documented as loaded when `ASPNETCORE_ENVIRONMENT=Docker`. MailPit host, port `1025`, and `UseSSL=false` therefore never apply unless compose duplicates every value; otherwise startup validation fails or SMTP uses port `587` with SSL.\n<!-- DESCRIPTION END -->\n\n<!-- BUGBOT_BUG_ID: df92a3f8-a67f-48bd-bc41-eb0a2ac31c30 -->\n\n<!-- LOCATIONS START\nKT.Shared.EmailProcessor.Iris/IrisEnvironmentKeys.cs#L10-L14\nKT.Shared.EmailProcessor.Iris/appsettings.Docker.json#L1-L25\nKT.Shared.EmailProcessor.Iris/AGENTS.md#L170-L171\nLOCATIONS END -->\n<details>\n<summary>Additional Locations (2)</summary>\n\n- [`KT.Shared.EmailProcessor.Iris/appsettings.Docker.json#L1-L25`](https://github.com/kwik-trip-iot/KT.Shared.EmailProcessor.Iris/blob/cb54abe52e1c0c40f3fd43ccf68785322385121a/KT.Shared.EmailProcessor.Iris/appsettings.Docker.json#L1-L25)\n- [`KT.Shared.EmailProcessor.Iris/AGENTS.md#L170-L171`](https://github.com/kwik-trip-iot/KT.Shared.EmailProcessor.Iris/blob/cb54abe52e1c0c40f3fd43ccf68785322385121a/KT.Shared.EmailProcessor.Iris/AGENTS.md#L170-L171)\n\n</details>\n\n<div><a href=\"https://cursor.com/open?\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/fix-in-cursor-dark.png\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/fix-in-cursor-light.png\"><img alt=\"Fix in Cursor\" width=\"115\" height=\"28\" src=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/fix-in-cursor-dark.png\"></picture></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://cursor.com/agents?\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/fix-in-web-dark.png\